r taxes applied thereafter. Therefore, due to rounding or precision errors, the sum of line `total_amount`s may not equal the invoice `total_amount`."}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":270,"p":{"k":["type","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"boolean"},{"t":1,"s":"When `true`, indicates that the actual pricing scheme for the line was tiered, so the `unit_price` shown is the blended average for all units."}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":271,"p":{"k":["type","format","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"string"},{"t":1,"s":"date"},{"t":1,"s":"Start date for the period covered by this line. The format is `\\\"YYYY-MM-DD\\\"`.\\n\\n* For periodic charges paid in advance, this date will match the billing date, and the end date will be in the future.\\n* For periodic charges paid in arrears (e.g., metered charges), this date will be the date of the previous billing, and the end date will be the current billing date.\\n* For non-periodic charges, this date and the end date will match."}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":272,"p":{"k":["type","format","description"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"string"},{"t":1,"s":"date"},{"t":1,"s":"End date for the period covered by this line. The format is `\\\"YYYY-MM-DD\\\"`.\\n\\n* For periodic charges paid in advance, this date will match the next (future) billing date.\\n* For periodic charges paid in arrears (e.g., metered charges), this date will be the date of the current billing date.\\n* For non-periodic charges, this date and the start date will match."}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":273,"p":{"k":["type"],"v":[{"t":1,"s":"integer"}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":274,"p":{"k":["type","description"],"v":[{"t":9,"i":275,"a":[{"t":1,"s":"integer"},{"t":1,"s":"null"}],"o":0},{"t":1,"s":"The ID of the product subscribed when the charge was made.\\n\\nThis may be set even for addon charges, so true product-only (non-addon) charges will also have a nil `addon_id`."}]},"o":0},{"t":10,"i":276,"p":{"k":["type","description"],"v":[{"t":9,"i":277,"a":[{"t":1,"s":"integer"},{"t":1,"s":"null"}],"o":0},{"t":1,"s":"Th